    <title>《银河护卫队》太空冒险版老友记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645cac020e550ce49dc2fd52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645cac020e550ce49dc2fd52</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 May 2023 08:17:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【前言】</span></p><p><span>这是一部接近完美的漫威电影，煲电影这么多期，我第一次打十分。刺激的动作戏配上恰到好处的歌，让坐在电影院的我完全地投入，根本没时间思考情节合不合理，时长是否过多。它甚至不算一部科幻片或者超级英雄电影，更像是太空冒险版老友记。</span></p><br><p><span>【煲time】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 打分和短评</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a> 火箭太让人心疼了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 大反派的变态造物主梦想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 银河护卫队像普通一家人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> 救朋友，但是不杀人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 我们也听懂了i am groot</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a> 电影的复古B级片审美</span></p><br><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@陈野熊&nbsp; @VickyChan__ @孤烟的围脖 &nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>【社群】</span></p><p><span>公众号：煲电影radio</span></p><p><span>听友群vx：BAODIANYING2022</span></p>]]></description>
