    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Apr 2023 09:42:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【前言】</span></p><p><span>引用一段影评：“如果你是灌篮高手的粉丝，但还需要看评分才决定去不去，那便可以不用去了。”</span></p><br><p><span>【煲time】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 打分和短评</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 宫城当主角是弥补遗憾，但回忆杀太散乱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 上半场倒是再来点镜头啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 比赛还原度很高，接近真实篮球</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 最喜欢的角色是阿牧、长谷川、三井</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 湘北最终没能夺冠，真实的青春就是有遗憾的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">30:47</a> 身边那些陨落的天才，缺一个安西教练</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> 关于晴子的画风、热血漫的作者</span></p><br><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@陈野熊&nbsp; @刘仁铖真不错 @徐兆YNWA</span></p><br><p><span>【社群】</span></p><p><span>公众号：煲电影radio</span></p><p><span>听友群vx：BAODIANYING2022</span></p>]]></description>
