    <guid isPermaLink="false">640056cf7fadb947290db317</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Mar 2023 07:40:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【前言】</span></p><p><span>黄子华主演的《毒舌律师》已经拿下过亿票房，打破了香港影史纪录。一句“法律面前穷人死定”，引起了大家的共鸣和压抑多时的愤怒。在金钱至上的香港，敢于用一部电影挑战权贵，重新找回正道之光属实不易。</span></p><br><p><span>【煲time】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 打分和短评</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 演员演技都在线，谢君豪更像真律师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 想写实，但一些情节又过于肥皂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> 香港影史第一，凭什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 法律面前穷人死定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 陪审团制度的利弊，插播《正义回廊》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a> 黄子华，香港代言人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 要为真小人争取地位，莫让伪君子霸占全世界</span></p><br><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@陈野熊&nbsp; @VickyChan__ @孤烟的围脖 &nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>【社群】</span></p><p><span>公众号：煲电影radio</span></p><p><span>听友群vx：BAODIANYING2022</span></p>]]></description>
