  <item>
    <title>《阳光小美女》一群神经病却是最好的家人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63212ab766d1de6e4ff9233e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63212ab766d1de6e4ff9233e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Sep 2022 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【前言】</span></p><p><span>“You do what you want, fuck the rest.”</span></p><p><span>成功和失败不需要他人定义，做自己想做的才最为关键。</span></p><p><span>就算全世界都说你是个loser，妈妈也总是觉得你最棒了，不是吗？</span></p><br><p><span>【煲time】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 剧情简介和推荐理由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 父母一句吐槽，孩子可能emo很久</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> “如果没有人看着我，那该多快乐”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> 人生就是一场接一场的选美</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 和其光，同其尘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> 家人要互相保护，更要互相尊重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> 失败就失败，接受自己的平庸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 有空和家人一起跳舞吧</span></p><br><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@陈野熊&nbsp; @VickyChan__ @孤烟的围脖 &nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>【社群】</span></p><p><span>公众号：煲电影radio</span></p><p><span>听友群vx：BAODIANYING2022</span></p>]]></description>
