    <guid isPermaLink="false">62fee28734db1571f0ecc9c7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Aug 2022 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【前言】(本期有剧透）</span></p><p><span>《断桥》的故事本身是有吸引力的，但因为几个关键情节的处理，让原本的犯罪悬疑片基本变成了喜剧片。唯二的亮点是曾剑的摄影和范伟的演技，相辅相成之下又为了范伟制造了一个经典角色，个人非常喜欢。</span></p><br><p><span>【煲time】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 打分和短评，有史以来最低分？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 纪录片式的暗黑视觉风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a> 范伟又一部封神之作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 王俊凯让人“眼前一黑”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 立个flag：以后不看马思纯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 杀人证据都有了，就是不报警！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> “与魔鬼共舞”的设定没有展开</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 和《少年的你》对比，完败</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 水军软文很多，谨慎观看</span></p><br><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@陈野熊&nbsp; @VickyChan__ @孤烟的围脖 &nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>【社群】</span></p><p><span>公众号：煲电影radio</span></p><p><span>听友群vx：BAODIANYING2022</span></p>]]></description>
