    <guid isPermaLink="false">62ec79faa296590a1ed4827b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Aug 2022 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【前言】</span></p><p><span>一半科幻一半喜剧，结果两头都不讨好，这便是《独行月球》尴尬的处境。从科幻片角度看，它的特效和场面不错，但逻辑站不住脚；从喜剧片角度看，可以说是开心麻花最不好笑的一部了，只是靠着沈腾强撑了下来。</span></p><br><p><span>【煲time】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 七夕爱情电影推荐（虽然已经过了)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> 打分和短评</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 科幻只是空壳，却没有玩飞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 人那么多哪来的独行啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 马丽很尴尬，沈腾很该死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> 看沈腾在月球那么快乐我都生气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2117">35:17</a> 审查制度下搞笑很难</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 喜剧片要有创意，不是只有文字梗</span></p><br><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@陈野熊&nbsp; @VickyChan__ @孤烟的围脖&nbsp; @小泽不尴尬</span></p><br><p><span>【社群】</span></p><p><span>公众号：煲电影radio</span></p><p><span>听友群vx：BAODIANYING2022</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
